  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p0119:b002:l006": "Кордукту койдой is an opaque sheep/disgrace simile; literal sheep image retained, precise idiom unresolved.",
    "manas-2010:p0119:b002:l015": "Чөл түшүрүп provisionally scattering/driving apart, repeated at119:17; literal desert-making sense possible.",
    "manas-2010:p0119:b002:l026": "Кара ниет rendered ill-disposed, preserving the narrator’s negative judgment of Jakyp.",
    "manas-2010:p0119:b002:l038": "Boiling misery and little foal are source idioms; metaphor preserved across line break.",
    "manas-2010:p0119:b002:l045": "Теңиз кыргыз literally sea of Kyrgyz, a multitude metaphor retained without a number.",
    "manas-2010:p0119:b002:l048": "Сийип means urinating; piss preserved across page boundary into kumys churn at120:1.",
    "manas-2010:p0120:b002:l009": "Огой interpreted the ancestral name Ogoy, although lower-case here; alternative common-noun reading unresolved.",
    "manas-2010:p0120:b002:l012": "Үбүмө interpreted wealth/possessions; unusual visible form retained in raw.",
    "manas-2010:p0120:b002:l015": "Drawing a line through us is literal image with implied destruction; object supplied contextually.",
    "manas-2010:p0120:b002:l019": "Чунак as contemptuous address rendered wretched son, not literal missing-ear description.",
    "manas-2010:p0120:b002:l027": "Тозгону interpreted тосгону/tos- stopping in the immediate parallel; raw unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p0120:b002:l033": "Not yet nine retained, alongside later four-year fostering and twelve-year age.",
    "manas-2010:p0120:b002:l047": "Burut retained as source exonym for Kyrgyz, not translator’s preferred ethnonym.",
    "manas-2010:p0121:b002:l024": "Iren retained source name; not normalized to a modern state.",
    "manas-2010:p0121:b002:l028": "Кадыр түн rendered Night of Power; positive/sacred expression is surprising in misery context, retained without emendation. Yudakhin gives both sacred night and seer senses: https://el-sozduk.kg/к/ .",
    "manas-2010:p0121:b002:l042": "Атаңдын көрү curse literally your father’s grave; retained at every recurrence rather than omitted or euphemized.",
    "manas-2010:p0121:b002:l044": "Go into the earth is a death curse; literal image retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0122:b002:l007": "Бейлесек, далай бейарман is syntactically uncertain. Бейарман means without regret, not full of regret; corrected initial opposite gloss. Thus, with much left unregretted remains provisional. https://el-sozduk.kg/БЕЙ/",
    "manas-2010:p0122:b002:l020": "Explicit hundred retained; атaгы (renown/name) makes construction awkward and remains represented, not silently changed into a count noun.",
    "manas-2010:p0122:b002:l031": "Арбактуу interpreted possession of ancestral spiritual prestige, not literal ghostly body.",
    "manas-2010:p0122:b002:l039": "Кызырлуу interpreted blessed by Kydyr, retaining the sacred association.",
    "manas-2010:p0122:b002:l042": "Каңырыгың түтөп is grief idiom rendered heart smokes; body-site metaphor approximate.",
    "manas-2010:p0123:b002:l007": "Мал күндү interpreted living for herds; visible phrase may be defective, not emended.",
    "manas-2010:p0123:b002:l016": "Кечээ literally yesterday commonly refers to the past in epic recollection; rendered literally, not a certified one-day chronology.",
    "manas-2010:p0123:b002:l020": "Measuring/dividing by a whip retained; exact distribution mechanism not invented.",
    "manas-2010:p0123:b002:l030": "Тирсек elbow/hock rendered elbows for human torture, no change of body part to ankle.",
    "manas-2010:p0123:b002:l033": "Cutting leather strips from a person’s back retained as narrated violence.",
    "manas-2010:p0123:b002:l037": "Exactly two thousand retained as number of sufferings; times supplied for English, not converted into years.",
    "manas-2010:p0123:b002:l038": "Corrected theological misreading: бардыгер is all/entire, not Almighty. The 2015 explanatory dictionary explicitly quotes this line followed by Баланы тартып алганда at https://el-sozduk.kg/БАРД/. Plural subject follows the oppressors in surrounding clauses; original Kyrgyz unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p0124:b002:l010": "Күң and кул in124:12 translated slave women and slaves; enslavement not softened.",
    "manas-2010:p0124:b002:l033": "Enemy supplied as subject of growing strong from жоонуку; exact conditional attachment is interpretive.",
    "manas-2010:p0124:b002:l037": "Жут is livestock-killing disaster, often winter starvation; rendered disaster without imposing a specific cause here.",
    "manas-2010:p0124:b002:l042": "Кашатча provisionally like a terrace/ledge; unusual measure of trampled ground retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0125:b002:l019": "Six san retained, repeated at125:29; san not converted into a precise census number.",
    "manas-2010:p0125:b002:l024": "Asyy retained traditional equine age unit, not years. https://el-sozduk.kg/asyy-4/",
    "manas-2010:p0125:b002:l036": "Кара байыр retained karabayyr horse term; казанат rendered battle steed, breed identification not asserted.",
    "manas-2010:p0125:b002:l037": "Sieve-like lungs and copper forelegs retained heroic horse anatomy metaphors.",
    "manas-2010:p0126:b002:l013": "Ээленсе кара калмактан has unusual case attachment; if Black Kalmyks go mad follows defense/oath context, provisional.",
    "manas-2010:p0126:b002:l021": "Туйгун goshawk is a praise epithet for insight; bird image retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0126:b002:l030": "Chong Jindi literally Great Madman, established alias retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0126:b002:l037": "Саатынан literally hour, interpreted ill-starred influence; exact construction uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0126:b002:l038": "Дүмүрчөгүм түзөтүп literally leveling my stump, a family-destruction image; no specific killing method added.",
    "manas-2010:p0126:b002:l047": "Чала rendered unfinished one as Jakyp’s disparaging description; not a medical diagnosis.",
    "manas-2010:p0127:b002:l004": "Ilek retained epic multitude unit rather than invented arithmetic.",
    "manas-2010:p0127:b002:l017": "Exactly twelve slain children in Jakyp’s report retained; not harmonized with80 adversaries earlier or four boys later.",
    "manas-2010:p0127:b002:l039": "Бадирек here interpreted wretch from complaint context. Dictionary also has heroic homonym used at136:19. https://el-sozduk.kg/badirek-2/",
    "manas-2010:p0128:b002:l001": "Кээни interpreted кеги/grudge from fear of reprisals; lexical reading unresolved, raw unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p0128:b002:l022": "Күбүмө literally my churn; stores provisionally interprets livestock-derived wealth here, perhaps defective for үбүмө. Unlike clear churn at120:1, reading unresolved.",
    "manas-2010:p0128:b002:l035": "Fortress on slope retained; abrupt terrain line not discarded as a heading.",
    "manas-2010:p0129:b002:l005": "Даңгыттарга жарат provisionally splitting him among Dangyts; could be a defective punitive expression. Name and violence retained, exact action unresolved.",
    "manas-2010:p0129:b002:l006": "Ай касаба interpreted crescent-crested banner; exact ornament terminology provisional.",
    "manas-2010:p0129:b002:l017": "Өлгөндө көргөн literally seen when dying, late-granted child idiom; at death’s door is figurative.",
    "manas-2010:p0129:b002:l022": "Төрөсү is her lord in visible source; preceding speech is hers, but subject not silently changed.",
    "manas-2010:p0129:b002:l034": "Belt hung about neck is pleading posture; no added self-harm meaning.",
    "manas-2010:p0129:b002:l045": "Kalmyks’ stone upon his crown retained literally; precise protective/identifying object unresolved.",
    "manas-2010:p0130:b002:l003": "Торконун күлүн interpreted finest silk, possibly гүлүн (flower/best of silk). Торко is valuable silk cloth, https://el-sozduk.kg/torko-3/ ; exact күлүн reading unresolved, raw unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p0130:b002:l022": "Аталып is being called/named; English self-naming is contextual, agency not certain.",
    "manas-2010:p0130:b002:l036": "Giving felt cloak to the boy follows130:35 dative; could be spreading it on ground for him. Exact action uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0130:b002:l047": "Таптай interpreted таппай in fourfold no-object-found formula; raw unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p0131:b002:l008": "Forty foot-lengths retained game-circle measure; no modern conversion.",
    "manas-2010:p0131:b002:l012": "Thousand lambs retained, not harmonized with later hundred or vague many.",
    "manas-2010:p0131:b002:l014": "Baglan is slaughter-ready lamb, with weaned/fattened gloss variation. Yudakhin gives exact verse formula and long vigorous boiling: https://el-sozduk.kg/baglan/ .",
    "manas-2010:p0131:b002:l018": "Баткал rendered mire; possible topographic usage remains uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0131:b002:l031": "Күлүстөн rendered joyous one from dictionary heroic epithet, not garden here. https://el-sozduk.kg/күлү/",
    "manas-2010:p0131:b002:l033": "Канжаркол retained Kanjar-kol; later source shortens to Kanjar, both forms preserved.",
    "manas-2010:p0131:b002:l034": "Жылмайгыр interpreted curse/accursed one; may be defective, exact etymology unresolved.",
    "manas-2010:p0131:b002:l040": "Loading with sand retained, context suggests weighting the swift horse/rider but no sack or quantity invented.",
    "manas-2010:p0131:b002:l041": "Жан казан is a small traveling kettle, not great cauldron; corrected after exact Yudakhin formula. https://el-sozduk.kg/к/",
    "manas-2010:p0132:b002:l001": "Эти турмак, бети жок is opaque flesh/face expression in terror context. Literal wording retained; not an assertion that all fleeing boys were anatomically mutilated.",
    "manas-2010:p0132:b002:l013": "Four boys slaughtered is explicit. The food meat at132:14 is not identified as their flesh; translation does not invent cannibalism.",
    "manas-2010:p0132:b002:l020": "Оодарышмай rendered mounted wrestling, the saddle-unseating contest.",
    "manas-2010:p0132:b002:l043": "Арача rendered stop/intervention appeal; not invented truce terms.",
    "manas-2010:p0133:b002:l007": "Forty-one including Manas retained, alongside forty companion formula after four deaths; no harmonization.",
    "manas-2010:p0133:b002:l035": "Attribution to God preserved as narrator’s wording.",
    "manas-2010:p0134:b002:l012": "Choro retained for warrior companions/retainers.",
    "manas-2010:p0134:b002:l027": "Кумка retained kumka; plainly abusive context but precise lexical gloss unresolved after repeated primary-dictionary searches. Specialist-review blocker, not omitted or replaced by an invented insult.",
    "manas-2010:p0134:b002:l030": "Как баш rendered bald; curse epithet may connote barren/childless old man rather than physical baldness, exact force uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0134:b002:l044": "Суук кол literally cold hand, interpreted thieving hand in seizure context; provisional idiom.",
    "manas-2010:p0135:b002:l007": "Kise is belt/pouch ensemble; pouch component interpreted after belt breaks. https://el-sozduk.kg/КИСЕ/",
    "manas-2010:p0135:b002:l025": "Кааласа interpreted searching for the boys from hilltop; could reflect defective караса. Raw unchanged.",
    "manas-2010:p0135:b002:l030": "Orompoy retained one-legged hopping combat game. https://el-sozduk.kg/ОРОМ/",
    "manas-2010:p0135:b002:l036": "Башка көрдү балдарды literally saw the boys differently/apart; precise relation to surrounding slaughter/feast unclear, retained provisional.",
    "manas-2010:p0135:b002:l038": "Young-horse racing may already refer to children pretending to be horses, explicitly жөө кунан at137:46. No extra actual animals supplied.",
    "manas-2010:p0135:b002:l043": "Ten thousand and a people’s leader retained in fantastic hut-capacity description; syntax uncertain, no real architectural claim.",
    "manas-2010:p0136:b002:l003": "Чолок interpreted short-tailed for lion; could mean another form of bodily shortening, not specified by text.",
    "manas-2010:p0136:b002:l006": "Секи жагы сексен төрт retained seki side/eighty-four. Секи usually ledge/platform, https://el-sozduk.kg/СЕКИ/ ; this formula may be corrupt (compare prior armed-companion84 formula), but no speculative repair. Lexical/source-reading blocker.",
    "manas-2010:p0136:b002:l010": "Боктуу is shit-filled; coarse wording retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0136:b002:l012": "Handle from wrist and casing from heart at136:14 retained fear idioms literally; no inferred real injury.",
    "manas-2010:p0136:b002:l019": "Corrected wretch to dauntless hero: explanatory dictionary quotes this exact passage under heroic бадирек II. https://el-sozduk.kg/badirek-2/ ; elephant-bodied бил мүчөлүү confirmed https://el-sozduk.kg/bil-5/ .",
    "manas-2010:p0136:b002:l032": "Комокойлуу is thickening of spear iron at haft joint, rendered thickened socket. https://el-sozduk.kg/КОМОКОЙ/",
    "manas-2010:p0136:b002:l037": "Ойротту retained Oirats as epic ethnonym; possible broader foes/world idiom not independently resolved.",
    "manas-2010:p0137:b002:l019": "Evil spirit seizing wife is source simile, not a medical diagnosis; birth/flight similes all retained.",
    "manas-2010:p0137:b002:l038": "Айткан сөздүн бекери rendered pointless to speak; exact rhetorical force uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p0137:b002:l046": "Жөө кунан is children racing while pretending to be young horses, including piggyback variation. https://el-sozduk.kg/ЖӨӨ/",
    "manas-2010:p0138:b002:l009": "Капыр infidel retained although directed at Manas by Oshpur; no religious harmonization.",
    "manas-2010:p0138:b002:l020": "Зыйкырчы understood sorcerer; visible spelling not normalized in raw.",
    "manas-2010:p0138:b002:l025": "The self/black-eyes parallel is syntactically opaque; literal sequence retained without adding a new observer.",
    "manas-2010:p0138:b002:l031": "Cut down river willows retained abrupt instruction; not silently changed to restraining boy.",
    "manas-2010:p0138:b002:l044": "Кара курт rendered black insects as multitude simile, not modern species identification.",
    "manas-2010:p0138:b002:l048": "Жети миз киши бирөөнү: seven is clear, миз retained miz. Likely defective numeral expression, perhaps миң (thousand), but not resolved by this witness; do not silently print seven thousand. Next page139:1 supplies beating/carcass question. This line remains draft and requires source collation."
  },
